  "notes": "Shadcn-like POS admin built on Geist. Electric blue #3248ff is used sparingly: active nav item (on #e8ebff tint), active segmented tab, selected order row outline/tint, customer strip text. Status pills are color-coded soft fills (yellow Pending, blue Preparing, green Ready, red Unpaid, orange table name 'Couch'). Detail panel ends with a full-width black Checkout button paired with a green-outlined Add Item button. A slim footer status bar shows user role, receipt printer connection, shift state and Diagnostics & Logs. Line items carry inline icon actions (edit, override price, void). Live page failed to load, so interactive behaviour was not verified."
